{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202606151221341428c66eca174bcb","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_9603c5b06bf74658bb06e989","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/src/tech-utils/work-queue/index.ts","old_string":"export interface ClaimedWorkItem {\n  workItemId: string;\n  owner: WorkOwner;\n  kind: string;\n  sourceRef: WorkSourceRef;\n  attempts: number;\n  queuedAt: string;\n  sourceVersion: number;\n  forms: EnqueueFormTarget[];\n}","new_string":"export interface ClaimedWorkItem {\n  workItemId: string;\n  owner: WorkOwner;\n  kind: string;\n  sourceRef: WorkSourceRef;\n  attempts: number;\n  queuedAt: string;\n  sourceVersion: number;\n  derivations: EnqueueDerivationTarget[];\n}"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e3b84da0-9927-4ff1-80ac-66420760c742","uuid":"9200ff07-7acd-47b9-b029-8f6fe3a46d07"}
